      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The shark's last action was a successful jaws Strike, and the target is adjacent to a solid surface like a wall or reef</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The shark attempts an Athletics check to Reposition the target into the adjacent surface. If successful, the target is thrown into the surface and takes 2d6 Bludgeoning Damage damage. If the surface is jagged (such as a reef), target instead takes 2d6 Slashing Damage] damage. This neither applies nor counts toward the shark's multiple attack penalty.</p>",
